    narr:narration """Tess Guest's recorded voice here centers on a product-channel conversation. She opens by [asking for a chat widget on a web form](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_18) — a request she repeats, [relayed through Tanya](narr:Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_28), suggesting it was a sticking point. She sketches [a simple install-and-return flow](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_60) as how she imagines setup working, and names [her unfamiliarity with the commit-and-pull backend](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_63), flagging where the developer's fluency outpaced her understanding. On substance, she offers [a conditional defense of text-message contact](narr:Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_9) — right in some contexts, a trust liability in skeptical ones. The register throughout is casual and plain-spoken, with a habit of framing requests as rhetorical questions.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_18> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_60> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_63> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_9> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_28> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Can you just give me a chat widget on a web form?" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_18> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Text message, in certain contexts, is absolutely the right move." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_9> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "texting is so associated with spam now that requiring someone to text might actually be a real downside" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_9> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Everything you said about committing and pulling and all of that is completely foreign to me." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_63> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "visit this link, install it, come back and say done" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_60> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "She holds both sides on texting: right move in some contexts, spam-adjacent trust risk in others — a genuine ambivalence, not a position." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_9> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Her concrete setup wish (install, return, done) sits against her admitted incomprehension of the actual backend workflow — aspiration vs. capability gap." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_60> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_63> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The widget request appears both in her own voice and relayed by another — the relayed copy should not be read as a firmer restatement." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_18> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_3RealChannelNotProduct20260428_28> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "style" ; narr:reading "rhetorical-question-first — she frames requests as questions that already argue their answer" ; narr:text "Can you just give me a chat widget on a web form?" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_18> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "register" ; narr:reading "casual and plain-spoken, with conversational fillers doing real work" ; narr:text "And so, you know, because I don't understand how that works" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_63> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "conviction" ; narr:reading "moves between hedged notions and flat claims — notions for what she'd like, claims for what she judges" ; narr:text "People might not want to give their number." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_9> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "temporal" ; narr:reading "concrete and future-facing when proposing, past-realis when diagnosing what confused her" ; narr:text "Some of the things you just were like, oh, clearly this one word is what it needs." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2RealTessChatWidget20260423_63> ] ;
